MACRO 1 PREF WORK '*' PROC '*'                                                  
* *                                                                             
* *    W W P R O D S L                                                          
* *                                                                             
* * !!! NOTE !!! THIS E+ CPY MAY NOT HAVE ALL 88 LEVELS SEEN IN                 
* * !!! NOTE !!! WWPRODSL COBOLCPY.                                             
* *                                                                             
* *    U S A G E :                                                              
* *                                                                             
* *        THIS COPYTEXT IS A DUAL-PURPOSE COPYTEXT. IF COULD BE USED           
* *    JUST TO DEFINE PRODUCT GROUP CONSTANTS, AND/OR COULD BE USED AS A        
* *    PROCEDURE TO TEST PRODUCT GROUP COMBINATIONS.                            
* *        IF THIS COPYTEXT IS NEEDED IN EPLUS PROGRAM, THEN THERE              
* *    MUST BE ATLEAST ONE DEFINITION IN THE WORKING STORAGE  AREA,LIKE         
* *    THIS...                                                                  
* *              %WWPRODSL  REQUIRED-PREFIX  WORK ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *        IF PRODUCT GROUP COMBINATIONS ARE TO BE TESTED, THE COPYTEXT         
* *    HAS TO BE AS ...                                                         
* *              %WWPRODSL  REQUIRED-PREFIX  PROC ''                            
* *                                                                             
* *     AT THE END OF THE JOB AND THE PROCEDURE IN THE COPYTEXT CAN BE          
* *     CALLED FROM ANYWHERE IN THE JOB LIKE...                                 
* *                                                                             
* *              PERFORM S25-CHECK-WS-KDPRODSL                                  
* *                                                                             
* *     I M P O R T A N T :                                                     
* *                                                                             
* *       - WHEN DEFINING NEW FIELDS IN THIS COPYTEXT,THE &&WORK FIELD          
* *         MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                                           
* *       - WHEN ADDING NEW PRODUCT GROUP PROCEDURES TO THIS COPYTEXT,          
* *         THE &&PROC FIELD MUST BE USED AT COLUMN 1.                          
* *       - WHEN ANY CHANGES ARE DONE, ALL THE EPLUS PROGRAMS THAT USE          
* *         THIS COPYTEXT MUST BE RECOMPILED.                                   
* *                                                                             
* *     E R R O R S :                                                           
* *                                                                             
* *       IN CASE OF ANY COMPILATATION ERRORS, PLEASE CHECK IF THE              
* *     CORRECT VALUES ARE PASSED TO THE &&WORK AND &&PREF PARAMETERS.          
* *     THE ONLY VALID VALUE FOR THESE PARAMETERS ARE ''.                       
* *                                                                             
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  KDPRODSL CONSTANT AND GROUP DEFINITIONS.                                   
* *                                                                             
&WORK DEFINE GOOD-KDPRODSL               W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCC                W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV               W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-LYNK               W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-POLESTAR           W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-BIMA               W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-LOCAL              W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-SPARE-PARTS        W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-CHEMICAL           W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-BYTES              W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-ACC                W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-WHEELS             W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-TOOLS              W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-EMB                W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-PARTS-CHEM         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-PARTS-BYTES        W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-PARTS-ACC          W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-X5-X7              W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-UTAN-EMB           W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-BRANDON            W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV-PARTS         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV-BYTES         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV-TOOLS         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV-EMB           W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VCBV-X5-X7         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-LOCAL-BYTES        W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-ALL          W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-UTAN-EMB     W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-PARTS        W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-BYTES        W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-WHEELS       W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
