&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-EMB          W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-VOLVO-BIMA         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-BIMA-LOCAL         W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
&WORK DEFINE KDPRODSL-LOCAL-EMB          W  2 P  VALUE 0                        
                                                                                
* *                                                                             
* *  PRODUCT GROUP TESTING PROCEDURES.                                          
* *                                                                             
&PROC.S25-CHECK-&PREF.KDPRODSL. PROC                                            
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC GOOD-KDPRODSL                = 0                                          
&PROC                                                                           
&PROC KDPRODSL-VCC                 = 0                                          
&PROC KDPRODSL-VCBV                = 0                                          
&PROC KDPRODSL-LYNK                = 0                                          
